rature range and machine operation required.)</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐋𝐄𝐒𝐒-𝐓𝐀𝐍𝐆𝐋𝐄 &amp; 𝐒𝐓𝐑𝐎𝐍𝐆𝐄𝐑 𝐓𝐎𝐔𝐆𝐇𝐍𝐄𝐒𝐒 - Full mechanical winding and strict manual examination, to make sure the line tidy and less-tangle, so as to avoid possible snap and line breaking; Larger spool inner diameter design makes feeding smoother. The Imported raw material upgrades with stronger toughness. It is not easy to break, meeting your demands for printing projects of functional parts with higher toughnes.</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐃𝐈𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐒𝐈𝐎𝐍𝐀𝐋 𝐀𝐂𝐂𝐔𝐑𝐀𝐂𝐘 &amp; 𝐂𝐎𝐍𝐒𝐈𝐒𝐓𝐄𝐍𝐂𝐘 - Advanced CCD diameter measuring and self-adaptive control system in the manufacturing guarantee these PLA filaments of 1.75 mm diameter, dimensional accuracy + / - .02 mm; 1kg/spool.</span></li>\n<li class=\"a-spacing-mini\"><span class=\"a-list-item\">🤗 𝐇𝐈𝐆𝐇 𝐂𝐎𝐌𝐏𝐀𝐓𝐈𝐁𝐈𝐋𝐈𝐓𝐘 &amp;𝟏𝟎𝟎% 𝐄𝐍𝐕𝐈𝐑𝐎𝐍𝐌𝐄𝐍𝐓𝐀𝐋-𝐅𝐑𝐈𝐄𝐍𝐃𝐋𝐘 - Compatible with 99% FDM &amp; FFF 3D printers (with heated beds) 3D Pen. Environmental protection, made from starch raw materials derived from renewable plant resources.</span></li>\n</ul>","images":["https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444009319-788195334.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444009268-167881988.png","https://storage.googleapis.com/ajr3dgalaxy.firebasestorage.app/product-import/1784444008189-303818871.png"],"variants":[{"id":"new-awxjz03","name":"red","sku":"PLA-FILAMENT-1-75MM-BUNDLE-PACK-RED","price":"2000","salePrice":"2000","dealerPrice":"5950","stock":10,"weight":2,"isDefault":true,"isActive":true,"variantImages":[],"images":[],"optionsData":[{"optionName":"Pack","valueStr":"red"}],"optionValues":{"Pack":"red"},"weightInGrams":2},{"id":"new-hhle1pz","name":"blue","sku":"PLA-FILAMENT-1-75MM-BUNDLE-PACK-BLUE","price":"2000","salePrice":"2000","dealerPrice":"5950","stock":392,"weight":2,"isDefault":false,"isActive":