rong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"772\">Net Weight:</strong> 1 kg (± 0.05 kg)</p>\n<p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"828\"><strong data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"814\">Print Temperature:</strong> 230°C – 260°C</p>\n<p data-start=\"792\" data-end=\"828\"><strong data-start=\"831\" data-end=\"858\">Heated Bed Temperature:</strong> 90°C – 110°C</p>\n<p data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"934\"><strong data-start=\"874\" data-end=\"888\">Tolerance:</strong> ± 0.02 mm for consistent, clog-free extrusion</p>\n<p data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"986\"><strong data-start=\"937\" data-end=\"951\">Roundness:</strong> &gt; 95% for smooth, jam-free feeding</p>\n<p data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1041\"><strong data-start=\"989\" data-end=\"1005\">Print Speed:</strong> 30 – 90 mm/s (Recommended: 50 mm/s)</p>\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1110\"><strong data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1069\">Recommended Platform:</strong> Glass plate with ABS slurry or PEI sheet</p>\n<p data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1127\"><strong data-start=\"1112\" data-end=\"1127\">Advantages:</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"1131\" data-end=\"1208\">🔧 <strong data-start=\"1134\" data-end=\"1159\">High Impact Strength:</strong> Withstands mechanical stress and rough handling.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1211\" data-end=\"1286\">🔥 <strong data-start=\"1214\" data-end=\"1244\">Excellent Heat Resistance:</strong> Maintains form and strength up to ~100°C.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1289\" data-end=\"1370\">💨 <strong data-start=\"1292\" data-end=\"1318\">Smooth Surface Finish:</strong> Prints with minimal warping and a sleek matte look.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1455\">🛠️ <strong data-start=\"1377\" data-end=\"1406\">Post-Processing Friendly:</strong> Easy to sand, machine, and acetone vapor smooth.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1458\" data-end=\"1546\">♻️ <strong data-start=\"1461\" data-end=\"1494\">Durable for Functional Parts:</strong> Ideal for automotive, enclosures, gears, and tools.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1548\" data-end=\"1565